<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλῠβ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small coin</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολλύβου</span>
			<i>for a doit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				85
			</span></i>: masc. acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				404
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—but neut. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλῠβον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.72
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>small gold weight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> neut. pl.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλυβα, τά</span>, <i>small cakes</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλαβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				768
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλλυβα: τρωγάλια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ., ὁ</span>,
				<i>rate of exchange,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).817
			</span></i> (pl., Tenos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				672.32
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <i>agio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Verr.</u>
				2.3.78.181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Att.</u>
				12.6.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				56.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. (Cf. Hebr.
				<i>[hudot ]ālap</i> 'change',
		'exchange'.)</div>
